# nextjs

Next.js usage and conventions.

- Use `next dev`, `next build`, `next start` for dev/build/prod.
- App directory: `src/app/` (routing, layouts, pages).
- File-based routing, layouts, and server components (Next.js 13+).
- Env vars: use `.env.local`.
- Docs: https://nextjs.org/docs
